// result_end

\caption(All prescribed heldout cases show weak deterministic and sampled reconstructions. Paired soft/hard samples come from the same perturbations.)
\alttext(Six rows of ten images compare true shapes, deterministic probability/MAP decoding, matched soft/hard noisy decoding and the stronger fitting mean.)

For prior generation, seed2963 supplies80 midpoint uniforms from the native bank's uniform
field, shaped as one4-coordinate row per generated case. IDs=floor(8U) yield four independent
uniform0..7 categories, then target-free hard decoding. These are prior codes, not aggregate-
posterior samples. Four8-way hard variables require12 raw symbol bits, excluding the network,
framing and any actual codec; soft simplex codes have no such twelve-bit claim.

```{cpp, results="markdown", file="figures/gumbel_priors.png", flags="-std=c++23 -O2 $(pkg-config --cflags --libs datamunge) -Wl,-rpath,$(pkg-config --variable=libdir datamunge)"}
